      "description": "A deadline in the week's Due row, in plain words and coloured by state.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-due\"><button class=\"ds-di\"><i></i><span><b>OS Lab write-up 4</b><small>23:59</small></span></button><button class=\"ds-di ds-di-done\"><i></i><span><b>DS Experiment 3 upload</b><small>23:59 · <strong>done</strong></small></span></button><button class=\"ds-di ds-di-over\"><i></i><span><b>DBMS ER diagram</b><small>17:00 · <strong>overdue</strong></small></span></button><button class=\"ds-di ds-di-miss\"><i></i><span><b>CN Quiz 1</b><small>10:30 · <strong>missed</strong></small></span></button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-due{display:grid;gap:5px;width:200px}.ds-di{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:7px;padding:6px 7px;border:1px solid var(--due-line,#d9ad00);background:var(--due-tint,#fff6d6);color:var(--graphite,#18171b);text-align:left;cursor:pointer;transition:border-color 160ms cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)}.ds-di:hover{border-color:var(--graphite,#18171b)}.ds-di:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--graphite,#18171b);outline-offset:2px}.ds-di i{flex-shrink:0;width:14px;height:10px;margin-top:3px;border:1.5px solid var(--due-line,#d9ad00);border-radius:50%;background:var(--due,#f5c400)}.ds-di span{display:grid}.ds-di b{font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.25}.ds-di small{margin-top:2px;font-size:11.5px;color:var(--graphite-2,#5d4a53);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-di-done{background:var(--good-tint,#e5f5ea);border-color:var(--good,#1d7440)}.ds-di-done i{background:var(--good,#1d7440);border-color:var(--good,#1d7440)}.ds-di-done strong{color:var(--good,#1d7440)}.ds-di-over{background:var(--bad,#c8261e);border-color:var(--bad,#c8261e);color:var(--on-bad,#fff)}.ds-di-over small{color:inherit;opacity:.9}.ds-di-over i{background:var(--on-bad,#fff);border-color:var(--on-bad,#fff)}.ds-di-miss{background:var(--bad-tint,#fde8e5);border-color:var(--bad,#c8261e)}.ds-di-miss b{text-decoration:line-through;text-decoration-color:var(--bad,#c8261e)}.ds-di-miss strong{color:var(--bad-text,#b4231b)}.ds-di-miss i{background:var(--sheet,#fff);border-color:var(--bad,#c8261e)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Summary Counts",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "summary-chip",
      "description": "One row of count chips; due yellow, overdue and missed red, others wash.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-sum\"><button class=\"ds-si\"><strong>6</strong> due</button><button class=\"ds-si ds-bad\"><strong>1</strong> overdue</button><button class=\"ds-si ds-bad\"><strong>1</strong> missed test</button><button class=\"ds-si ds-plain\"><strong>1</strong> without a date</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-sum{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}.ds-si{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;height:36px;padding:0 12px 0 4px;border:1px solid var(--ink-rule,#efc3d2);background:var(--sheet,#fff);color:var(--graphite,#18171b);font-size:14px;cursor:pointer}.ds-si:hover{border-color:var(--graphite,#18171b)}.ds-si:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--graphite,#18171b);outline-offset:2px}.ds-si strong{min-width:28px;padding:2px 6px;background:var(--due,#f5c400);color:var(--on-due,#2b2100);font-family:var(--font-condensed),\"Sofia Sans Condensed\",\"Arial Narrow\",sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:16px;line-height:1.2;text-align:center;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-bad strong{background:var(--bad,#c8261e);color:var(--on-bad,#fff)}.ds-plain strong{background:var(--ink-wash,#fdf3f7);color:var(--graphite,#18171b)}"
